---
title: "SVD Through Variational Principles: From Geometry to Kernels"
description: "How Suykens' LS-SVM reformulation connects classical linear algebra to nonlinear extensions and attention mechanisms"
author: "Franck Albinet"
date: "2026-01-07"
categories: [Linear Algebra, Kernel Methods, LLMs]
